<title>USA: Enterbank Holdings IPO priced at $15.50/share.</title>
<headline>Enterbank Holdings IPO priced at $15.50/share.</headline>
<dateline>CLAYTON, Mo. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enterbank Holdings Inc said it is making an initial public offering of a maximum of 451,612 shares and a minimum of 193,548 shares of common stock, with shares priced at $15.50 apiece.</p>
<p>The shares are offered by the company through certain corporate officers and directors.</p>
<p>Enterbank Holdings, a bank holding company, said it intends to use proceeds from the sale of its shares to expand its business in St. Charles County and Sunset Hills, Mo.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
